      "bio": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;\">\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://nezukouploads.servegame.net/file/2bDXA.jpg\" alt=\"Monte Dev\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" style=\"object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0px; border: 2px solid #555;\">\n</div>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\" style=\"font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px;\">MONTE DEV</h1>\n<h3 align=\"center\" style=\"color: #888;\">Software Developer | API Creator | Server Administrator</h3>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n╭—˙ . ꒷ 🍰 . 𖦹˙———————╮\n</div>\n\n### ⚙️ STACK & TECHNOLOGIES\n- **Core:** Node.js, Python\n- **WhatsApp Automation:** Baileys Library\n- **Infrastructure & Deployment:** Pterodactyl, Cloudflare DNS, Linux/Termux, HidenCloud\n- **Database & Auth:** Firebase\n\n### 📂 FEATURED PROJECTS\n- **NEZUKO AI:** Custom WhatsApp application framework featuring advanced media conversion utilities and interactive section menus.\n- **ARAB code:** Web-based code-sharing platform with integrated Firebase user verification rules.\n- **Microservices & API:** Deployment of server instances bound to  network zones via secured DNS.\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n╭—˙ . ꒷ 🍰 . 𖦹˙———————╮\n</div>\n\n### 🔗 CONNECT\n- 🌐 **Domain:** <a href=\"http://www.monte-dev.online\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #007BFF;\">monte-dev.online</a>\n- 💬 **WhatsApp Channel:** <a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7AkG84inotOc8BXE1K\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #25D366;\">Join Community</a>\n- 📸 **Instagram:** <a href=\"https://instagram.com/monte4g\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #E1306C;\">@monte4g</a>\n\n</div>\n",
